    "Fresh integrated110-row report oct15-datalink-category-destination identifies technology0x42B190 and social0x42B630 as nonexact. Effect0x42B7E0 and corrected project/faction are exact; do not change them.",
    "Pinned technology initializes ID140000 and prerequisite cursor0x94F380 (Technology base0x94F358+0x28), tests both prerequisites and advances across all0x59 rows including filtered rows. Use genuine RulesTechnology records, preserving loads, text, language and callback-visible reads.",
    "Pinned social initializes ID120001 with SocialCategories cursor0x94B014; four groups advance ID by5, emitting headerID=id-1 followed by four choice IDs. Verify full traversal before editing, preserving all per-choice live reads and callbacks.",
    "No public signatures, layouts, buffer sizes, compiler flags, original spans or historical claims change. No raw-offset or artificial pointer adapters. Actual-source host tests must cover first/last rows, skips, IDs, strings and callback-visible updates with failing mutants.",
    "Measure all110 owner identities, inspect physical collateral, build/link and check claims/references before coordinator-reviewed manual integration; only native recorder banks exact claims. Unknown linked/runtime acceptance remains unknown."
  ],
